  <Placemark>
      <name>SAN POTITO E COTIGNOLA STOCCAGGIO</name>
      <description><![CDATA[<h3>Concessione di Stoccaggio</h3><h2>SAN POTITO E COTIGNOLA STOCCAGGIO</h2><br><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid grey;"><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Codice</th><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Conferimento</th><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Periodo&nbsp;di&nbsp;vigenza</th><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Scadenza</th><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Superficie</th></tr><tr><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;" align=right>2924</td><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;">24/04/2009</td><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;" align=center>1&ordm; periodo</td><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;">24/04/2039</td><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;" align=right>51,76 km<sup>2</sup></td></tr></table><u>Note</u><br>Data di scadenza variata ai sensi del Decreto Legge 18 ottobre 2012 n. 179 (articolo 34, comma 18).<br>Il titolo &egrave; vigente da 6.131 giorni (circa&nbsp;16&nbsp;anni&nbsp;e&nbsp;10&nbsp;mesi).<br><br><div style=&apos;margin-bottom:5px;&apos;>TITOLARI</div><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid grey;"><tr><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Operatore</th><th style="padding: 4px; background-color:#E4E4E4; color:grey; border: 1px solid grey;">Quota</th></tr><tr><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;">STOCCAGGI GAS ITALIA (STOGIT)(r.u.)</td><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;" align=right>90%</td></tr><tr><td style="padding: 2px 4px 2px 4px; border: 1px solid grey;">BLUGAS INFRASTRUTTURE</td><td 